// Breeze application icon. Resource 1 is the group icon GPUI loads when it
// registers its window class, and the icon Explorer, shortcuts, and the taskbar
// read from breeze-app.exe.
//
// The path is relative to the crate root: rc.exe resolves resource files against
// its working directory (the crate root), and embed-resource sets the same
// directory for llvm-rc. Keeping this file and the working directory together
// avoids embedding a checkout-specific absolute path.
1 ICON "../../assets/brand/breeze.ico"
